> Request for Comments · Accepted · Mar 2026

## 元数据

| 字段 | 值 |
|------|------|
| **RFC 编号** | RFC-001 |
| **标题** | OpenCode Android Client 技术方案 |
| **状态** | Accepted + Phase 8 SSH Host Profiles Draft |
