### Channels and platform threading

Source: https://docs.flutter.dev/platform-integration/platform-channels.md

When invoking channels on the platform side destined for Flutter, invoke them on the platform's main thread (the UI thread on Android). When invoking channels from Flutter destined for the platform side, calls must originate from the root Isolate or an Isolate registered as a background Isolate. Platform-side handlers can execute either on the main thread or on a background thread if using a Task Queue.

